So the practical update after investment is $\text{capital placed}
\quad \longrightarrow \quad
\text{organization} + \text{talent} + \text{focus}.$ This is the operating mechanism behind the check. The investor is not simply buying a claim about the future. The investor is trying to help the young company become coherent enough to reach that future.

